    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the seasonings: olive oil, cumin, chili powder, salt, and pepper. Stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-southwest-salmon-with-salsa/#wprm-recipe-54399-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Keto-Southwest-Salmon-with-Salsa-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Completely spread the seasonings onto the salmon filets with a brush. Cook the salmon over a frying pan on medium heat and let cook for 5-8 minutes on both sides.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-southwest-salmon-with-salsa/#wprm-recipe-54399-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Keto-Southwest-Salmon-with-Salsa-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop the onion, slice the avocados, tomato, and jalapeno.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-southwest-salmon-with-salsa/#wprm-recipe-54399-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Keto-Southwest-Salmon-with-Salsa-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer them in a serving bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-southwest-salmon-with-salsa/#wprm-recipe-54399-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Keto-Southwest-Salmon-with-Salsa-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix them together and garnish with the chopped parsley.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-southwest-salmon-with-salsa/#wprm-recipe-54399-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Keto-Southwest-Salmon-with-Salsa-6.jpg"
